          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Your wellness routine, simplified. The right products delivered on your schedule, at a price that makes staying consistent easy.<\/strong><\/p><p>20% off every order, automatically.<\/p><p>Monthly delivery so you never run out, our \"no empties\" promise.<\/p><p>Control your own delivery date with every order.<\/p><p>Skip, pause, or cancel anytime. No hassle, no questions.<\/p><p><strong>We give you a heads up<\/strong>. A friendly reminder email arrives five days before every order processes giving you time to add products, skip a month, pause, or make any changes before anything ships. No surprises ever.<\/p>",
            "text_size": "typeset2",
            "secondary_color": false
          }
        },
